                      "fill": "$text-muted",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "3. Workspace autonomy uses a danger-tinted card: it changes what every future approval looks like. Copy for this row needs CPO/CLO sign-off before build.",
